.TH batten-attribution 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-attribution \- What produced commits may carry about the tooling that made them
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten attribution\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
What produced commits may carry about the tooling that made them
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-attribution\-check(1)
Refuse vendor authorship, branding or session links in commit metadata
.TP
batten\-attribution\-identity(1)
Set this clone\*(Aqs repo\-local git identity when it is unset or denied
.TP
batten\-attribution\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
